BAB 16  •  FUNDAMENTAL KE FULL-STACK

JavaScript Fundamental untuk Vue


Vue menggunakan JavaScript. Jika array, object, function, dan async/await belum dipahami, Vue
akan terasa seperti magic.

16.1 Variable dan tipe


   ●  ●  ●   JAVASCRIPT
   const nama = "Andi";
   let umur = 20;
   const aktif = true;
   const nilai = [80, 90, 75];
   const user = { id: 1, name: "Andi" };


16.2 Function


   ●  ●  ●   JAVASCRIPT
   function tambah(a, b) {
     return a + b;
   }

   const kali = (a, b) => a * b;


16.3 Array method


   ●  ●  ●   JAVASCRIPT
   const angka = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5];

   const ganda = angka.map(n => n * 2);
   const genap = angka.filter(n => n % 2 === 0);
   const total = angka.reduce((sum, n) => sum + n, 0);


16.4 Destructuring dan spread


   ●  ●  ●   JAVASCRIPT
   const user = { id: 1, name: "Andi" };
   const { id, name } = user;

   const updated = { ...user, name: "Budi" };

16.5 async/await dan fetch


  ●  ●  ●   JAVASCRIPT
  async function loadUsers() {
    const response = await fetch("http://localhost:8080/api/users");

    if (!response.ok) {
      throw new Error("Gagal mengambil data");
    }

    return await response.json();
  }

17.4 Lifecycle + fetch


   ●  ●  ●   VUE
   <script setup>
   import { onMounted, ref } from "vue";

   const users = ref([]);
   const loading = ref(true);

   onMounted(async () => {
     try {
       const response = await fetch("http://localhost:8080/api/users");
       users.value = await response.json();
     } finally {
       loading.value = false;
     }
   });
   </script>


